msgid "XID is an identity provider. The instance domain is the OIDC issuer, API base URL, Hosted Auth base URL, and console base URL. Organizations provide policy, branding, membership, and resource isolation."
msgstr "XID is an identity provider. The instance domain is the OIDC issuer, API base URL, Hosted Auth base URL, and console base URL. Organizations provide policy, branding, membership, and resource isolation."

